Career XP 🚀

A gamified personal productivity dashboard for tracking habits, attendance, daily progress and goals.

Features:
•Habit tracker with daily check-ins
•Attendance records and CSV export
•Daily activity log
•XP points, levels and streaks
•Monthly progress charts
•Automatic saving in browser storage
•Download and restore a JSON backup
•Responsive layout for desktop and mobile

Run locally:
1.Download or clone this repository.
2.Open index.html in a modern browser.

GitHub Pages:
In the repository, open Settings → Pages. Choose Deploy from a branch, select main and / (root), then save.

Data and privacy:
Career XP stores its data in the browser's localStorage. Data does not automatically sync between browsers or devices. Use Download backup before clearing browser data or moving devices. Restore a previously downloaded JSON backup with Restore backup.

Built with:
HTML, CSS and JavaScript.
Career XP — Build habits. Earn XP. Level up.